{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2491550/extras/c84c1ec0295221d4eca986e684e94768.avif?t=1760352650\" width=1560 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201c<i>Sometimes I dream of rivers dying and mountains stripped of life. Of water evaporating, mud and dry bark. These dreams are cries of despair, terrifying sobs from a dying planet. All life, devoured by disaster, united in a single voice that cries out in anguish for the return of those who fought to defend it.</i>\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2491550/extras/92aaec2ad82b794714f77d3d149a75b4.poster.avif?t=1760352650\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2491550/extras/92aaec2ad82b794714f77d3d149a75b4.webm?t=1760352650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is <strong>Kuu</strong>\u2019s story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wandersky</strong> is a skybound <strong>top-down</strong> adventure with <strong>a single arrow</strong> and <strong>a flying house</strong>. <strong>Kuu</strong> and her companion <strong>Tama</strong> are on a mission to restore the land of <strong>Hyndara</strong>. Explore a huge world filled with puzzles, enemies and quests: <i>the sky always carries those who dare to wander\u2026</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2491550/extras/ae2919d1f0261427da919bf94c4e33a5.avif?t=1760352650\" width=1560 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2491550/extras/ddf2bd0d584c37409383d6965a01e86d.poster.avif?t=1760352650\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2491550/extras/ddf2bd0d584c37409383d6965a01e86d.webm?t=1760352650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your single arrow and its incredible powers to defeat the <strong>Oremite</strong> plague and solve all kinds of puzzles.Adapt to each situation or enemy using your wits and an intuitive control system.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control</strong>, <strong>move</strong>, <strong>push</strong> and <strong>pull</strong> the arrow to find each enemy's <strong>weak spot,</strong> solve intricate <strong>puzzles</strong> and collect <strong>materials</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2491550/extras/c4cecc461d9a4a52e8f825dcab491e19.avif?t=1760352650\" width=1560 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2491550/extras/22bc05fdd172d2f3c2e33dc7ab8de581.poster.avif?t=1760352650\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2491550/extras/22bc05fdd172d2f3c2e33dc7ab8de581.webm?t=1760352650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the skies with the <strong>Genbu house</strong>, your primary means of transport and home. Travel across the vast world of Hyndara, sailing across the sea of clouds and making your way through the ancient <strong>Mizu ruins</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here you will prepare for adventure: <strong>forge</strong> your weapons and amulets, <strong>cook</strong> delicious dishes, and <strong>brew</strong> powerful <strong>potions</strong> using the materials you have found along the way. The Genbu is much more than a refuge: it is the beating heart of your expedition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2491550/extras/31804cc81d3b1492b2511fc7d6bebc73.avif?t=1760352650\" width=1560 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2491550/extras/dd7f98009e20767015e88122d11209e7.poster.avif?t=1760352650\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2491550/extras/dd7f98009e20767015e88122d11209e7.webm?t=1760352650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on your journey through both the <strong>sea of clouds</strong> and the vast <strong>biomes</strong> of Hyndara, meet all kinds of peculiar <strong>characters</strong>, and exchange <strong>resources</strong> through bartering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover spectacular landscapes and hidden corners as you unveil an enormous map full of mysteries. Let yourself be guided by a moving and atmospheric soundtrack that turns every discovery into an emotional memory, transforming your adventure into something much greater.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2491550/extras/f32604d5196dadfd7167fef67adc6458.avif?t=1760352650\" width=1560 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2491550/extras/728bf4cabf387125a06f763529f175e8.poster.avif?t=1760352650\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2491550/extras/728bf4cabf387125a06f763529f175e8.webm?t=1760352650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are curious about the <strong>secrets</strong> hiding in the skies of Wandersky, feel free to follow us on our social channels to uncover more about Kuu, the Oremite plague and the mysteries waiting in Hyndara. From emotional lore drops to sneak peeks of puzzles, enemies, and cozy sky-home moments;\u00a0 there\u2019s so much to discover together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay safe, wanderer. And remember: <strong>the sky always carries those who dare to wander.</strong><br><strong></strong><br><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>*</strong>Wandesky is a game under development. The result of the images and videos do not represent the final product.<strong> </strong><br>**It will be translated to many languages, not only to Spanish and English.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2491550?t=1760352650","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2491550/5df03de15804e607934598357092e5ef29efa1a5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760352650","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2491550/353384